  "content": "\n\n<h3><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jwqbqlS.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"2250\" height=\"375\"></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Благодарность<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nerfashton/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Nerfashton</a> за вдохновляющие текстуры для этого пака</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0iEjhu6.png\" width=\"1384\" height=\"77\"></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><br>Текстурный пак для мода <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-cursor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cursors Extended</a>, который меняет ваши курсоры на тематические курсоры Ben 10. <br><br>Идеально дополняет<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alienevo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Alien Evolution</a>.</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/omnicraft-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q4zmTA0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"271\" height=\"192\"></a>Представлен в <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/omnicraft-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Omnicraft: Ben 10</a><br><br></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0iEjhu6.png\" width=\"1384\" height=\"77\"></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fapexhost.gg%252fBen10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1221978/description_20a86c04-33c2-4156-a305-bc230da764bc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></a></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br><br><br></h3>",
